c) Use the code, in whole or in part, in another public mod or commercial product.

d) Remove or alter this license notice or the copyright headers.

e) Claim authorship of the original implementation.


3. THIRD-PARTY NOTICE
---------------------

The atmospheric model, parameter ranges and storm life-cycle structure are inspired by
"ProtoManly's Weather" (PMWeather) by ProtoManly, which is itself distributed under an
All Rights Reserved license.

This project is an INDEPENDENT REIMPLEMENTATION for Minecraft Forge 1.20.1. It contains
none of the upstream project's source code, shaders, textures or audio assets. All audio
cues reuse vanilla Minecraft `SoundEvent`s; no custom .ogg files are shipped.

The physics used here (Magnus saturation vapour pressure, Bolton virtual temperature,
CAPE/CINH integration, Rankine vortex) is public-domain meteorology.

Minecraft is a trademark of Mojang Studios. This project is not affiliated with or
endorsed by Mojang Studios or by the PMWeather author.


